  "language": "en",
  "policy_type": "healthcare",
  "source_text": "Hospital EHR Access Policy\n\nOnly doctors can prescribe medication.\nNurses may view patient records during business hours.\nNurses can view any patient record in an emergency.\nPhysicians may update medical records of patients in their department.\nBilling staff can view billing records but cannot view medical records.\nReceptionists can create and update appointments.\nPsychotherapy notes can only be read by psychiatrists.\nContractors cannot access patient records unless they are on the corporate network.\nNobody may delete audit logs.\nAll other access is denied.\n",
